WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- All right.

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:02.250
We are back and it's season four.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.600
We are in New York city

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.550
and we are celebrating
Hispanic heritage month

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.787
with Lin-Manuel Miranda,
Ozuna and Angie Martinez.

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:10.890
(crowd cheers)

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:14.430
- So last season, Angie
and I played some games

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.290
out in Coney Island here in New York city.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.113
And well things didn't go her way.

00:00:18.113 --> 00:00:18.946
(crowd laughs)

00:00:18.946 --> 00:00:19.779
Yeah.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:20.612
- She was in, I grew up

00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:21.600
in Coney island and I was trying to be,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.370
I was trying to show her
a little hospitality.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.600
- [Kelly] Yes, yeah.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.433
- And let her have a moment.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.966
And then she took it too far.

00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:29.160
- You are so kind, you are so kind.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.440
So it's time for a rematch
with a game in honor

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.559
of Hispanic heritage month
called "Angie's Second Shot."

00:00:34.559 --> 00:00:35.517
(crowd laughs)

00:00:35.517 --> 00:00:38.184
(upbeat jingle)

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.790
(Ozuna and Kelly clap)

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.350
- When I, when I pick on
you, it's love, it's love.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.650
- It's crazy.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:46.028
I don't know why I come here for this.

00:00:46.028 --> 00:00:47.911
Why am I subjecting myself to this?

00:00:47.911 --> 00:00:49.530
Ozuna, listen,

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.512
I just wanna make sure that
you're focused here because

00:00:51.512 --> 00:00:53.340
- Let's go, let's go.
- All right.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.950
- So wait, teams are me and Lin,

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.668
versus Angie and Ozuna.

00:00:57.668 --> 00:00:59.720
(group laughs)

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:00.553
- I don't know what we're
playing but I got it.

00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:02.389
- I got it.

00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:03.690
Okay, Lord, are you there?

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.580
Do you mind hosting this game for us?

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.840
- [Lord] Hola, Kelly.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.160
You see what I did there?

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.160
- I did, God, you are so clever.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.890
- [Lord] Yeah, I'm
sorry, I'm busy right now

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:13.077
turning the oceans into coquitos.

00:01:13.077 --> 00:01:14.850
(everyone laughs)

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:15.720
- [Kelly] Amen, hallelujah.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.240
- [Lord] So everybody get
ready to have a good time.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.770
I will read a question

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:22.470
about something or someone Hispanic.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.810
Could be from Hispanic pop culture,

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.790
could be from Hispanic cuisine.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.560
You just have to wait and see.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.990
Now, if you want to answer for your team,

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.480
you just hit your button
and you give it a shot.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.710
You can buzz in early

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.230
but then you won't hear
the rest of the question

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.200
and the other team will
have a chance to steal.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.580
Here's your first question.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.413
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:45.257
- Jennifer Lopez.
(everybody laughs)

00:01:45.257 --> 00:01:49.470
- [Kelly] Wouldn't it be
amazing if it was correct.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.550
- [Lord] All right, here you go.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:51.570
- The odds were good.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:55.266
- [Lord] What Colombian actress
starred for 11 seasons on

00:01:55.266 --> 00:01:56.220
(buzzer beeps)

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.289
- Oh, oh, I know this one.

00:01:57.289 --> 00:01:59.038
- He rang it first.

00:01:59.038 --> 00:02:00.402
(crowd laughs)

00:02:00.402 --> 00:02:01.351
- Sofia Vergara.

00:02:01.351 --> 00:02:03.403
- [Lin and Kelly] Sofia Vergara.

00:02:03.403 --> 00:02:04.486
(bell chimes)

00:02:04.486 --> 00:02:05.910
- [Lord] It is Sofia Vergara.

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:06.743
(crowd claps)

00:02:06.743 --> 00:02:08.439
That's a fun name to say that's right.

00:02:08.439 --> 00:02:09.497
- [Kelly] Way to hit it fast.

00:02:09.497 --> 00:02:10.500
- [Lord] So that's Lin-Manuel and Kelly.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.360
You guys got one point, look at that.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.193
- Hey.

00:02:13.193 --> 00:02:14.026
- You have to get closer to it.

00:02:14.026 --> 00:02:16.283
- [Lord] Better watch out
Angie, better watch out.

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:19.140
All right now here's your next question.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:21.450
This Puerto Rican actress known

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.207
for West Side Story was the first actress

00:02:23.207 --> 00:02:24.510
(buzzer beeps)

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.826
- Rita Moreno.

00:02:25.826 --> 00:02:26.659
(bell chimes)

00:02:26.659 --> 00:02:27.870
- It is Rita Moreno, look at that.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.463
Uh oh, uh oh.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:32.160
- Yeah, I, I shoulda got that too.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:32.993
I just didn't.

00:02:32.993 --> 00:02:33.990
Yeah, I don't know what I'm doing.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.640
- [Lord] Here's your next question.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.230
What was the title

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:41.930
of Disney's first Latin
American animated film?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.147
(buzzer beeps)

00:02:43.147 --> 00:02:44.786
- "Coco."

00:02:44.786 --> 00:02:45.952
(loud buzz)

00:02:45.952 --> 00:02:46.973
- Oh, is it?

00:02:46.973 --> 00:02:47.893
- [Angie] Do you know it?

00:02:47.893 --> 00:02:50.820
- First, the first one ever?

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:51.653
- I don't know.

00:02:51.653 --> 00:02:53.280
- Can we go again if they don't know?

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.330
- [Lord] Well what goes

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.163
- [Angie] No, you can not, no, no.

00:02:55.163 --> 00:02:55.996
- Well then maybe say something.

00:02:55.996 --> 00:02:57.450
- They got it wrong.
- Spit something out.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:58.800
- [Lord] Five more seconds.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.789
- Somebody in the audience?

00:03:00.789 --> 00:03:01.727
- No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:03:01.727 --> 00:03:03.125
Don't you do it, don't you do it.

00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:04.973
(crowd laughs)

00:03:04.973 --> 00:03:06.690
(loud buzz)
- [Kelly] No cheating.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.298
- [Lord] The answer was Encanto.

00:03:08.298 --> 00:03:09.271
- [Kelly] Encanto.

00:03:09.271 --> 00:03:10.104
- Oh.

00:03:10.104 --> 00:03:11.092
- [Kelly] I thought you would know that.

00:03:11.092 --> 00:03:12.693
- The only reason I thought it wasn't is

00:03:12.693 --> 00:03:14.860
because I was like well if it
was that then he would know.

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:16.080
- Coco, Coco is Pixar.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.977
I looked at you and then you
didn't say it so I thought

00:03:17.977 --> 00:03:19.530
"I don't wanna sound a dumb ass."

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.519
- Oh, Disney animation versus Pixar.

00:03:20.519 --> 00:03:21.352
- Yeah.

00:03:21.352 --> 00:03:22.185
- [Angie] I was gonna say that.

00:03:22.185 --> 00:03:23.018
- I don't know if you noticed.

00:03:23.018 --> 00:03:25.004
- That's really embarrassing
I did that then.

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:25.977
(Ozuna laughs)

00:03:25.977 --> 00:03:27.840
- We should just win, we should just win.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:28.942
- [Lin] Feel very embarrassing.

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.883
- That should be like a forfeit.

00:03:30.883 --> 00:03:32.370
- Anne Hathaway beat me on a game

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.273
because she did "Since You've
Been Gone" and I didn't.

00:03:35.273 --> 00:03:36.182
(audience laughs)

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.015
So it happens to the best of us.

00:03:37.015 --> 00:03:39.068
- [Lord] The answer
once again was Encanto.

00:03:39.068 --> 00:03:40.890
- Yes, I'm familiar with
the film, thank you.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.768
- [Lord] That's right, Lin-Manuel.

00:03:42.768 --> 00:03:43.601
(everybody laughs)

00:03:43.601 --> 00:03:45.450
It's your chance to redeem
yourself, now Lin-Manuel.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.283
Don't you worry.

00:03:46.283 --> 00:03:47.198
- Okay.

00:03:47.198 --> 00:03:48.450
- [Lord] I got your back, here we go.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:51.540
In 2019, the library of Congress

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.984
preserved the Richie
Valens version of this song

00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:54.817
(buzzer beeps)

00:03:54.817 --> 00:03:55.650
- [Angie and Lin] La Bamba!

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.483
- I said it first.
- I hit it first.

00:03:56.483 --> 00:03:58.016
- We said it, we said it, we said it!

00:03:58.016 --> 00:03:59.497
- La Bamba, La Bamba, La Bamba.

00:03:59.497 --> 00:04:00.955
- He said it!

00:04:00.955 --> 00:04:02.498
(group sings)

00:04:02.498 --> 00:04:03.331
- [Lord] That is correct.

00:04:03.331 --> 00:04:04.664
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah.

00:04:04.664 --> 00:04:07.990
(everybody laughs)

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.564
- Just 'cause you sing it doesn't mean

00:04:09.564 --> 00:04:10.920
- This was red, this was red.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:12.031
We hit it first.

00:04:12.031 --> 00:04:12.907
- [Audience Member]
Yeah, you had, you had.

00:04:12.907 --> 00:04:14.460
- I said it first.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.293
Does it matter?

00:04:15.293 --> 00:04:17.236
- No, no.
- Wow.

00:04:17.236 --> 00:04:18.657
- Hey, what's up?
- Hi.

00:04:18.657 --> 00:04:20.441
- Hey.

00:04:20.441 --> 00:04:22.804
(audience claps)

00:04:22.804 --> 00:04:25.230
- Remember that time, that it's still

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.762
an epic fail for you personally.

00:04:26.762 --> 00:04:28.148
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:28.148 --> 00:04:29.483
- I know, Pixar, it was Pixar.

00:04:29.483 --> 00:04:31.530
- I know, I didn't hear
the specifics either.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.420
But I looked to you cause
I was like Encanto, right?

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.490
And you were like Coco
and I was like, sure.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.380
- [Lord] So there you
go, Lin-Manuel and Kelly.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.068
You are the winners, you've done it.

00:04:39.068 --> 00:04:39.901
(everybody cheers)

00:04:39.901 --> 00:04:40.734
You've done it.

00:04:40.734 --> 00:04:42.314
I didn't think you could,
to be honest with you.

00:04:42.314 --> 00:04:44.100
I didn't think you could, but you did it.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.240
- Yes. I love it.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.073
Thank you, Lin.

00:04:46.073 --> 00:04:49.789
Thank you to my winning
partner, Lin-Manuel Miranda.

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:51.134
(crowd cheers)

00:04:51.134 --> 00:04:52.742
Angie Martinez and Ozuna for playing.

00:04:52.742 --> 00:04:54.272
- Never coming back here.

00:04:54.272 --> 00:04:56.022
- I know I will win, Angie, I know.

